The proposed solution supports health interoperability standards (HL7, FHIR, National Health Identifier INS, National Framework S-GUR du Numérique en Santé, Mon Espace Santé DMP) and integrates with hospital information systems (SIH) and electronic patient records (DPI). We provide change management support, including staff training, to ensure a smooth transition.

