The total cost of the proposed solution is within the authority's budgetary capacity, with an annual operating cost that remains controlled and compatible with the authority's budgetary constraints. Our approach ensures data sovereignty, with hosting performed on SecNumCloud-qualified infrastructure or equivalent, and particular attention paid to dependency on non-European suppliers.

We believe that our proposal meets all the requirements and constraints outlined in the call for tenders, providing a comprehensive solution that enhances the overall value proposition for hospital staff while ensuring compliance with regulatory requirements and environmental sustainability.
